			],
			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Rename VSCode API namespaces for consistency\n\nThis commit refactors the VSCode API implementation in Grove to follow a more consistent and semantically clear naming convention. The changes align with the broader Land ecosystem's approach to API design.\n\nKey changes:\n- Rename `Commands` → `CommandNamespace` to match the namespace pattern used in the actual VS Code API\n- Rename `Languages` → `LanguageNamespace` for consistency\n- Rename `Extensions` → `ExtensionNamespace` for consistency\n- Fix `CreateFilesParams` → `CreateFileParams` to correctly represent singular parameter semantics\n- Update all corresponding `impl` blocks and struct field references\n- Refine documentation comments for constructor methods\n\nThis follows the recent cleanup effort (88e037db) and prepares the Grove element for future VSCode API implementation work by ensuring type names are accurate and namespaces follow a predictable naming scheme.",
			"SHA": "27849886247f9d16d167d00193b944bdc0afeb73"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-02-27T13:19:39Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⡿⠀⠀⠀",
				68,
				25
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Clean up unused variable warnings and dead code across codebase\n\nThis commit addresses compiler warnings related to unused variables and dead code throughout the Grove Element. The changes allow for a cleaner build output and prepare the codebase for future development.\n\nKey changes include:\n- Prefix unused parameters with underscore (e.g., `_message`, `_args`, `_callback`)\n- Add `#[allow(dead_code)]` attributes to structs and fields that are intentionally defined for future use\n- Remove unused imports (`Context`, `Serialize`, `Bytes`, etc.) from multiple modules\n- Simplify variable mutability where not required (e.g., `store_limits` in Runtime.rs)\n- Refine error message formatting in VSCode API stubs\n\nAffected modules span the entire Grove architecture:\n- **API**: vscode.rs (VSCode API placeholder implementations)\n- **Binary**: RuntimeBuildMod.rs, Entry.rs (build and entry point)\n- **Common**: traits.rs (trait definitions)\n- **Host**: APIBridge.rs, Activation.rs, ExtensionHost.rs, ExtensionManager.rs, Lifecycle.rs (extension lifecycle management)\n- **Protocol**: SpineConnection.rs (protocol communication)\n- **Services**: ConfigurationService.rs, mod.rs (service abstractions)\n- **Transport**: IPCTransport.rs, Strategy.rs, WASMTransport.rs, gRPCTransport.rs (transport layer)\n- **WASM**: FunctionExport.rs, HostBridge.rs, MemoryManager.rs, ModuleLoader.rs, Runtime.rs (WASM runtime)\n\nNo functional changes - purely cleanup/refactoring to reduce compiler noise.",
			"SHA": "88e037db74f900180587e61b3e21f726206d8e70"
		}
	],
